  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<h1 align=\"center\">DeepSeek Chat</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>在 DeepSeek Harness 中，一键切换网页聊天与原工作区。</strong></p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>简体中文</strong> · <a href=\"README.en.md\">English</a></p>\n\n---\n\nDeepSeek Chat 是一款 **DSH 桌面插件**。选择 **CHAT**，即可在 DSH 内使用真实的 [DeepSeek Chat 官网](https://chat.deepseek.com/)；选择 **HARNESS**，随时返回原来的工作区。\n\n当前发布版 **0.2.11** · 适用于 **DSH 桌面版** · CHAT 网页的语言、外观和字号跟随 DSH。"
    },
    {
      "section": "在 DSH 里使用 DeepSeek 网页聊天",
      "text": "- 在 DSH 内使用官网聊天，并在侧栏浏览已加载的对话、置顶和日期分组。\n- 搜索、打开历史对话，或通过顶部“新会话”开始聊天。\n- 通过对话右侧的菜单重命名、置顶、分享和删除对话。\n- 点击“对话”右侧的刷新图标，更新官网页面和对话列表。\n- 语言、明暗主题和内容字号自动跟随 DSH 设置。"
    },
    {
      "section": "随时切回 HARNESS",
      "text": "通过左上角 DeepSeek 品牌旁的 **CHAT / HARNESS** 切换器选择模式。切回 HARNESS 会恢复之前的主面板，再进入 CHAT 时回到刚才的网页。\n\n**文字样式**\n\n**图标样式**：聊天气泡代表 CHAT，代码符号代表 HARNESS。\n\n可在 **设置 → Chat 设置 → 切换按钮** 中选择这两种样式。文字样式下，**CHAT 和 HARNESS 两个按钮的文案都可以自定义**，例如把 HARNESS 改为 CODE，修改后点击 **保存** 即可。侧栏较窄时文案会自动截断，悬停可查看完整内容。"
    },
    {
      "section": "独立的官网登录与登录记忆",
      "text": "在 **设置 → Chat 设置** 中查看官网账号、登录状态或退出登录。CHAT 使用独立的网页登录，不与其他浏览器或 DSH 平台账号共享登录状态。\n\n正常登录后，插件会尝试保存网页登录授权，并在重开同一个 DSH 配置环境时恢复；官网授权过期后仍需重新登录。"
    },
    {
      "section": "按名称安装（当前发布版）",
      "text": "在 DSH 插件安装输入框中输入：\n\n```text\ndsh-deepseek-chat@0.2.11\n```\n\n也可以使用命令行：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-deepseek-chat@0.2.11\n```\n\n首次安装和更新已有插件均可使用。刚发布的版本若被 DSH 的发布时间策略暂时拦截，可稍后重试。"
    },
    {
      "section": "从 GitHub 安装",
      "text": "在 DSH 插件安装输入框中粘贴：\n\n```text\nhttps://github.com/xingxingbk-git/dsh-deepseek-chat\n```\n\n或使用命令行：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add https://github.com/xingxingbk-git/dsh-deepseek-chat\n```\n\n此方式安装仓库中已推送的版本，无需手动构建。需要系统已安装 Git；Windows 可先安装 [Git for Windows](https://git-scm.com/install/windows)，再重开 DSH。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用本地安装包",
      "text": "将 `.tgz` 安装包交给 DSH 插件管理器，或使用命令行：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add /absolute/path/dsh-deepseek-chat-0.2.11.tgz\n```\n\n将路径替换为实际安装包位置。\n\n**安装或更新后，请完整退出并重新打开 DSH。** 使用其他配置环境时，将命令中的 `desktop` 替换为对应名称。更多说明参见 [DSH 官方插件安装文档](https://deepseek-harness.github.io/deepseek-harness/en/develop/basic/publish)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始使用",
      "text": "1. 选择 **CHAT**，点击 **登录 DeepSeek**，在插件内的官网页面正常登录。\n2. 登录后，账号和对话列表会自动同步；可在 **设置 → Chat 设置** 查看当前官网账号与登录状态。\n3. 在 **DSH 设置 → 通用设置** 调整语言、外观和字号，CHAT 会自动跟随。\n4. 需要返回原工作区时，切换到 **HARNESS**。退出官网账号可在 **Chat 设置** 中操作。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用说明与限制",
      "text": "- **运行环境：**适用于 DSH 桌面版，兼容 0.2.0-rc.2 及从 0.2.1-rc.1 开始的 0.2.1 发布线；0.2.2 及以上版本需要适配，暂不支持 DSH Web。\n- **对话列表：**列表和搜索仅包含官网已加载的导航内容。官网页面结构变化可能影响账号或列表识别，可根据界面提示重试。\n- **登录状态：**登录记忆仅用于同一 DSH 配置环境；授权过期、撤销或官网登录机制变化后，可能需要重新登录，不保证永久免登录。\n- **草稿与刷新：**模式切换会保留网页，但刷新、停用、卸载或退出 DSH 前，请先保留未发送内容。插件不会额外备份草稿。\n- **快捷键与网页能力：**Harness 原有的新会话快捷键和菜单仍作用于 HARNESS；CHAT 请使用其顶部“新会话”按钮。下载、设备权限和部分弹窗受 DSH 的浏览器安全策略限制。"
    },
    {
      "section": "隐私与数据",
      "text": "聊天内容和账号历史由 DeepSeek 官网处理。插件为显示账号与导航，读取官网可见的昵称、对话标题、分组和链接；这些导航信息仅在当前登录期间保留于内存。\n\n登录记忆只保存官网授权所需的最小信息，通过 DSH 官方凭据服务管理，并按配置环境隔离。退出登录会清除本插件的登录记忆。\n\n插件不会将密码、Cookie 或聊天正文保存到登录记忆中，不读取 DSH 或其他插件的令牌，也不访问其他浏览器的登录数据。"
    },
    {
      "section": "卸载",
      "text": "在 DSH 插件管理器中移除，或执行：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop remove dsh-deepseek-chat\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<h1 align=\"center\">DeepSeek Chat</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Switch between DeepSeek web chat and your Harness workspace in one click.</strong></p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"README.md\">简体中文</a> · <strong>English</strong></p>\n\n---\n\nDeepSeek Chat is a **DSH Desktop plugin**. Choose **CHAT** to use the real [DeepSeek Chat website](https://chat.deepseek.com/) inside DSH, or choose **HARNESS** to return to your original workspace."
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "Published release: **0.2.11** · Built for **DSH Desktop** · The CHAT website’s language, appearance and text size follow DSH."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use DeepSeek web chat inside DSH",
      "text": "- Chat on the website inside DSH and browse loaded conversations, pinned chats and date groups in the sidebar.\n- Search and open existing conversations, or start one with the top New Chat button.\n- Use each conversation’s menu to rename, pin, share or delete it.\n- Refresh the website page and conversation list using the icon beside Chats.\n- Language, light/dark appearance and content text size follow DSH settings automatically."
    },
    {
      "section": "Switch back to HARNESS",
      "text": "Use the **CHAT / HARNESS** switch beside the DeepSeek brand at the top left. Returning to HARNESS restores the previous main panel; switching back to CHAT returns to the retained website page.\n\n**Text style**\n\n**Icon style**: a chat bubble represents CHAT, and a code symbol represents HARNESS."
    },
    {
      "section": "Switch back to HARNESS",
      "text": "Choose either style in **Settings → Chat settings → Mode switch**. In text mode, **both the CHAT and HARNESS button labels are customizable**—for example, rename HARNESS to CODE, then click **Save**. Labels truncate automatically in a narrow sidebar; hover to see the full text."
    },
    {
      "section": "Separate website sign-in and login memory",
      "text": "Open **Settings → Chat settings** to view your website account and sign-in status, or sign out. CHAT has its own website session, separate from other browsers and the DSH platform account.\n\nAfter a normal sign-in, the plugin attempts to save the website grant and restore it when you reopen the same DSH profile. An expired website grant still requires a new sign-in."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install by package name (published release)",
      "text": "Enter this in the DSH plugin installer:\n\n```text\ndsh-deepseek-chat@0.2.11\n```\n\nOr use the CLI:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-deepseek-chat@0.2.11\n```\n\nUse the same method for a first installation or an update. If DSH’s release age policy temporarily blocks a newly published version, retry later."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install from GitHub",
      "text": "Paste this URL into the DSH plugin installer:\n\n```text\nhttps://github.com/xingxingbk-git/dsh-deepseek-chat\n```\n\nOr use the CLI:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add https://github.com/xingxingbk-git/dsh-deepseek-chat\n```\n\nThis installs the version already pushed to the repository, with no manual build required. Git must be installed; on Windows, install [Git for Windows](https://git-scm.com/install/windows) if needed, then reopen DSH."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install a local package",
      "text": "Give the `.tgz` package to the DSH plugin manager, or run:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add /absolute/path/dsh-deepseek-chat-0.2.11.tgz\n```\n\nReplace the path with your package location.\n\n**Fully quit and reopen DSH after installation or an update.** Replace `desktop` with the appropriate name when using another profile. See the [official DSH plugin installation documentation](https://deepseek-harness.github.io/deepseek-harness/en/develop/basic/publish) for more information."
    },
    {
      "section": "Getting started",
      "text": "1. Choose **CHAT**, click **Sign in to DeepSeek**, and sign in normally on the website inside the plugin.\n2. Your account and conversation list update automatically. View your current website account and sign-in status in **Settings → Chat settings**.\n3. Adjust language, appearance and text size in **DSH Settings → General**; CHAT follows automatically.\n4. Switch to **HARNESS** whenever you need your original workspace. To sign out of the website, use **Chat settings**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Notes and limitations",
      "text": "- **Environment:** DSH Desktop is required. The compatibility range covers 0.2.0-rc.2 and the 0.2.1 release line starting at 0.2.1-rc.1. Versions 0.2.2 and above require adaptation. CHAT is not supported in DSH Web.\n- **Conversation list:** The list and search cover only navigation content already loaded by the website. Website layout changes may affect account or list recognition; use the retry action shown in the interface.\n- **Sign-in:** Login memory is specific to the same DSH profile. Expired or revoked grants, or changes to the website’s sign-in mechanism, may require signing in again. Permanent sign-in is not guaranteed.\n- **Drafts and refresh:** Switching modes retains the website page, but preserve unsent text before refreshing, disabling, uninstalling or quitting DSH. The plugin does not separately back up drafts.\n- **Shortcuts and website capabilities:** Existing Harness new-session shortcuts and menus still act on HARNESS. Use CHAT’s top New Chat button for website conversations. Downloads, device permissions and some popups are limited by DSH’s browser security policies."
    },
    {
      "section": "Privacy and data",
      "text": "DeepSeek’s website handles chats and account history. To display the account and navigation, the plugin reads visible account names, conversation titles, groups and links. Navigation information is kept only in memory during the current sign-in session.\n\nLogin memory contains only the minimum information needed for website authorization. It is managed through the official DSH credentials service and isolated by profile. Signing out clears the plugin’s saved login."
    },
    {
      "section": "Privacy and data",
      "text": "The plugin does not include passwords, cookies or message bodies in login memory, read tokens belonging to DSH or other plugins, or access other browsers’ sign-in data."
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
      "text": "Remove the plugin through the DSH plugin manager, or run:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop remove dsh-deepseek-chat\n```"
    }
  ],
